# Offline template tests. No ansible, no pod, no network: these two are the whole
# dependency set, deliberately, so CI and an editor resolve the same thing.
#
# This is the input. requirements.txt is the lock, with every hash; regenerate it after
# editing this file (tools/requirements/README.md):
#   uv pip compile --universal --generate-hashes --python-version 3.12 \
#     platform/tests/requirements.in -o platform/tests/requirements.txt
# Install: pip install --require-hashes -r platform/tests/requirements.txt
#
# 3.1.6 is the first release clear of PYSEC-2026-1471 through 1475.
